    "steps": [
      "Drain the kimchi, keeping its juice for later.",
      "Set a large wok or nonstick skillet over medium heat and warm the sesame oil.",
      "Add the diced luncheon meat and fry until crisp.",
      "Stir in the drained kimchi and sauté until fragrant and deeper in colour.",
      "Add the rice and break up any clumps, then pour in the kimchi juice and soy sauce.",
      "Keep stirring for 5–10 minutes, adding a splash more sesame oil only if the rice sticks, until evenly coloured and lightly toasted.",
